description: i18n — no hardcoded UI strings; camelCase keys in hy/ru/en
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx,json}
alwaysApply: true
---

# Localization (i18next)

- No hardcoded user-facing strings in JSX/TS: labels, placeholders, tooltips, titles, empty states, notifications, `aria-label`, `alt`, option labels.
- Everything the user sees goes through `useTranslation` / `t(...)`.
- Strings live under `src/i18n/locales/` (`hy`, `ru`, `en`). Same key in all three. Source language for new keys is English.
- Keys are camelCase nested paths (`header.nav.home`, `heroSection.titleLine1`). Do not use kebab-case (`header-1st-line`).
- Prefer the nearest existing locale namespace (usually `common.json`). Do not add a new locale file per tiny component.
- Do not invent a parallel labels/Tanker flow — i18next JSON only.
